{"server":"tw","storyId":"act20side_level_act20side_02_beg","groupId":"act20side","stageId":"act20side_02","title":"下墜","storyCode":"IC-2","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act20side/level_act20side_02_beg.txt","sourceHash":"bc8d181daf18f11005f21a80ea8ae3401a9adb162a30ef81afdcbb020158670d","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"來到了樂園“大水坑”的眾人，經過表決後正式被杜林人接納，與設計代表一同在這暢玩了起來。嘉維爾兩人也找到了前往地下的嚮導。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_caveentrance"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有句諺語是怎麼說的來著，就是煌總掛在嘴邊那句——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"兩點之間，直線最短。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_074","isRemote":false,"text":"我有一個大膽的推斷，是不是因為你們這些雨林人生在這地方已經足夠倒楣了，所以別的方面運氣都格外的好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_074","isRemote":false,"text":"要不然為什麼你們至今都還沒滅絕？完全說不通。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說明這是一種行之有效的生存方式。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"大祭司，杜林的城市是什麼樣子的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_074","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......記不得了，說明很無聊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_074","isRemote":false,"text":"我大概一百多年前在地下世界裡待過一陣，現在唯一能回想起來的感覺就是糟糕透頂，到處都是蠢蛋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_074","isRemote":false,"text":"甚至還沒有在河邊看源石蟲睡覺來得有意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_074","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，唔，好吧，年輕人就是該多經歷經歷。要像我一樣好奇心旺盛才行！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_074","isRemote":false,"text":"順便，下個路口左轉，不要往下跳！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"大祭司，我們走了多遠了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_074","isRemote":false,"text":"好問題，人生的路沒有盡頭，只管邁開步伐往前走，反正還有我這個老傢伙看著你們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_074","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，要是說離那座城市還有多遠的話，如果你們能像我一樣穿過石頭，那再垂直降落個五六百米就到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"祖瑪瑪，你到底是怎麼忍受這傢伙到現在的？實在太吵了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"一般和機器待在一起的時候他會安靜一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這把鏈鋸算不算機器？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_074","isRemote":false,"text":"哼！沒禮貌！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"你看，很有用。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"30_g2_fountainlake"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"avg_npc_572_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這就是......這就是！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"avg_npc_572_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，“大水坑”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"......先把杜林的取名風格放在一邊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"這個水上樂園從遠處看就已經很驚人了，走近了看更是......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"杜林人，平常到底過著一種怎樣的生活啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_571_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呀吼！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"這傢伙，什麼時候把泳裝都換上了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"avg_npc_572_1","isRemote":false,"text":"極、極境先生，請小心！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_571_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔哦，好危險！你沒事吧？酒沒灑吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜林青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_567_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......真是稀奇，沒見過的地上人怎麼會出現在這裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜林青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_567_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且看上去已經和杜林人一樣傻乎乎了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"您好，先生，是斯第奇·畫布邀請我們來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"avg_npc_572_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他說，他說......總之就是想讓我們幫他一點小忙！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜林青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_567_1","isRemote":false,"text":"斯第奇·畫布嗎......他居然又回來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜林青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_567_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還以為他會和他那位可敬的老師一樣，就此告別我們的城市。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜林青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_567_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我很想直接說歡迎你們，杜林人並不排外，但是很遺憾，斯第奇可以橫衝直撞，不管不顧杜林的規矩，我不行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜林青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_567_1","isRemote":false,"text":"自我介紹一下，我叫卡奇·敘光，是這座城市的設計代表。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡奇·敘光","speakerId":"avg_npc_567_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別那麼緊張，過程很快的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"你......這是什麼意思？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_571_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？氣氛是不是突然有點奇怪？這麼多人同時向我敬酒我可受不了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"avg_npc_572_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們......！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"avg_npc_572_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要打架嗎！我可不怕你們這些小矮個兒！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"avg_npc_572_1","isRemote":false,"text":"讓你們見識見識嘉維爾教我的打架技巧！呼......擺好架勢，腰部發力！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"avg_npc_572_1","isRemote":false,"text":"準備接招吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌亂的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她、她在幹嘛？！拿棍子敲人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"緊張的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚啊啊啊啊！你不要過來啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡奇·敘光","speakerId":"avg_npc_567_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，喂！你們在搞什麼！停下！停下！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"avg_npc_572_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？不是要打架嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡奇·敘光","speakerId":"avg_npc_567_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們杜林人沒有那麼無聊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡奇·敘光","speakerId":"avg_npc_567_1","isRemote":false,"text":"收起你們的武器，跟我來！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"30_g4_durinsquare"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡奇·敘光","speakerId":"avg_npc_567_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳嗯！際崖城的居民們，這是這個季度的第四百一十七次表決。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡奇·敘光","speakerId":"avg_npc_567_1","isRemote":false,"text":"繼上上次我們決定本月際崖城的通用背景音樂，上次我們決定本周路燈的燈光顏色後，又有一個新的問題擺在了我們面前。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡奇·敘光","speakerId":"avg_npc_567_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鑑於這個問題也並不特別重要，在場的各位應該足以代表際崖城的決斷了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡奇·敘光","speakerId":"avg_npc_567_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天的議題是：際崖城迎來了新的訪問者，我們該不該接納他們？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"東倒西歪的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"東倒西歪的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"訪問者在哪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"東倒西歪的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聽說是個不喝酒的傢伙？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡奇·敘光","speakerId":"avg_npc_567_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，不是，是站在我們面前的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"東倒西歪的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"兄弟，乾杯！你說怎麼會有不喝酒的杜林呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_571_1","isRemote":false,"text":"乾杯！是啊，真是奇怪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"東倒西歪的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喝完了這一桶，該去玩水了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_571_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，讓你們開開眼界，瞧瞧我們地上人的本事！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"特米米，我再問你一次，你在羅德島的生活真的沒問題嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"avg_npc_572_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大、大概吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"實在不行就回來，壞環境對人的負面影響不可小覷！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"東倒西歪的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡奇，快點！咱們還有一大堆正事要做呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"東倒西歪的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"兄弟，你有沒有聽說過，一種叫做衝浪的玩法？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_571_1","isRemote":false,"text":"衝浪？那我可真是太熟悉了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我反對！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這些傢伙不能信任！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，我就知道，事情哪有這麼簡......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恍惚的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，那邊那個醉醺醺的黎博利！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_571_1","isRemote":false,"text":"依娜姆，他們喊你，我可沒醉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恍惚的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就是你，手裡拿著杯子的那個！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_571_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"搖晃的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_573_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你得講清楚你到底是喜歡高貴的蜜釀還是無聊的烈酒！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恍惚的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們老卡爾蜜釀愛好者協會張開雙臂歡迎你，而你現在居然和那幫烈酒渣滓混在一起？我太失望了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"搖晃的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_573_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們剛剛還在摟著肩膀一起喊著蜜釀萬歲，轉頭你就和那幾個宵小之輩混在一起？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_571_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，不，我覺得都很美味......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恍惚的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這可不行！我們不歡迎中立派！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"東倒西歪的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，笑死人了，沒有對比哪知道什麼叫好東西呢？對吧，兄弟？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"東倒西歪的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別怕，說出你真實的想法，聊聊你對偉大烈酒的感受，如果你還想在際崖城待下去的話——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"搖晃的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_573_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，烈酒渣滓，不准威脅他！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"東倒西歪的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖，蜜釀混蛋，喝你們的兒童飲料去吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恍惚的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有本事別跑！我們晚上去大桶酒吧較量個高下！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"東倒西歪的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，比誰兒童飲料喝得多？要鬥就鬥點夠意思的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡奇·敘光","speakerId":"avg_npc_567_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，停！在圓形廣場的表決是莊嚴而神聖的！喝酒的事我們稍後再說——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡奇·敘光","speakerId":"avg_npc_567_1","isRemote":false,"text":"舉起你們的手，讓它代表你們的態度，貫徹你們的意志，少數服從多數是際崖城永恆的原則。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡奇·敘光","speakerId":"avg_npc_567_1","isRemote":false,"text":"計票，開始！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"30_i02"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"搖晃的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_573_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，你要舉手我就不舉！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"東倒西歪的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我就舉我就舉，氣死你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"搖晃的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_573_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等會去滑梯邊等著，看我濺你一臉水！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"東倒西歪的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就你那點可笑的技術？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡奇·敘光","speakerId":"avg_npc_567_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，不錯，一次很莊嚴的表決。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"一般情況下，這種場合能稱得上莊嚴嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"30_g4_durinsquare"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡奇·敘光","speakerId":"avg_npc_567_1","isRemote":false,"text":"計票結束，結果還算明顯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡奇·敘光","speakerId":"avg_npc_567_1","isRemote":false,"text":"際崖城的市民做出了選擇，在這裡盡情遊玩吧，地上人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜林人們","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"乾杯！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡奇·敘光","speakerId":"avg_npc_567_1","isRemote":false,"text":"順便一提，作為建築設計師，湖上那個華麗的大傢伙就是我的得意作品，歡迎你們去玩個痛快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"就是那個“大水坑”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡奇·敘光","speakerId":"avg_npc_567_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......名字是大家表決出來的，不是我起的！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"30_g10_lakegarden"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯第奇·畫布","speakerId":"avg_4054_malist_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那片“大水坑”......是不是又加了不少東西？比我走的時候看起來更糟糕了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"耶奇·地心","speakerId":"avg_npc_564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那可是卡奇小子的得意傑作，你可別在他面前這麼說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯第奇·畫布","speakerId":"avg_4054_malist_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他還不值得我去為他指出設計上的不足。不如說，簡直無從指正！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯第奇·畫布","speakerId":"avg_4054_malist_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那坨扭曲的結構......我看一眼就要暈過去！為什麼際崖城的人居然能忍耐他來當這個設計代表？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"耶奇·地心","speakerId":"avg_npc_564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大概是大滑梯玩起來真的很爽吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯第奇·畫布","speakerId":"avg_4054_malist_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是我來操刀的話......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"耶奇·地心","speakerId":"avg_npc_564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你會拿清水混凝土建一個橫平豎直的，呃，方塊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯第奇·畫布","speakerId":"avg_4054_malist_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你還是太不瞭解我了，耶奇老頭，我只打算在那裡放置一片狹長的混凝土條帶，簡潔才是美。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"耶奇·地心","speakerId":"avg_npc_564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，連滑梯的功能都沒有？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯第奇·畫布","speakerId":"avg_4054_malist_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要傾斜一點角度的話也不是不行......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"耶奇·地心","speakerId":"avg_npc_564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳，該回到正題了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"耶奇·地心","speakerId":"avg_npc_564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這穹頂現在看起來似乎沒有大問題，但實在是讓我擔心......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯第奇·畫布","speakerId":"avg_4054_malist_1","isRemote":false,"text":"自從半年多前地震，穹頂開始漏水以後，這玩意滲漏得越來越厲害，你管這叫沒有大問題？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"耶奇·地心","speakerId":"avg_npc_564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至少際崖城的市民們是這麼覺得的。水流變大了？那激流勇進就更刺激了！溫控系統壞了？那就當夏天還沒有結束！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"耶奇·地心","speakerId":"avg_npc_564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至於源石勘測系統......反正際崖城附近已經二十多年沒檢測到活性源石層啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯第奇·畫布","speakerId":"avg_4054_malist_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，短視！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"耶奇·地心","speakerId":"avg_npc_564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯第奇·畫布","speakerId":"avg_4054_malist_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不修，這破爛穹頂有什麼好修的。我已經回答你一百萬遍了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"耶奇·地心","speakerId":"avg_npc_564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你當初跑到地面上去，難道不就是去想辦法的？思考可行的穹頂修復方案之類的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯第奇·畫布","speakerId":"avg_4054_malist_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，主要是為了躲你啦，你太煩了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"耶奇·地心","speakerId":"avg_npc_564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這話是不是有點過分？前幾個月我還被推選進了際崖城最和藹老人前一百呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯第奇·畫布","speakerId":"avg_4054_malist_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行了，我知道你擔心穹頂的狀態。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯第奇·畫布","speakerId":"avg_4054_malist_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但如果卡奇連現今狀態下穹頂的強度問題都解決不了，那別說設計代表的位子，他真該直接滾出際崖城了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯第奇·畫布","speakerId":"avg_4054_malist_1","isRemote":false,"text":"從結果上來說，穹頂的安全問題應該還不需要擔心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯第奇·畫布","speakerId":"avg_4054_malist_1","isRemote":false,"text":"溫控系統就放著吧，我看親愛的市民們玩得起勁得很呢。等他們膩了，說不定就要舉手讓際崖城變成冬天了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯第奇·畫布","speakerId":"avg_4054_malist_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有那個源石勘測系統，要我說，本來也不怎麼可靠，你一直追著我到處跑，最擔心的不就是這個系統嗎？我倒是有一個新方案。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯第奇·畫布","speakerId":"avg_4054_malist_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不如我們把之前地震震壞的鐵路橋重新修起來，把那些已經震塌的隧道挖開，在那裡直接安裝探測源石的儀器，讀數還準確些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯第奇·畫布","speakerId":"avg_4054_malist_1","isRemote":false,"text":"本來，這座穹頂的功能也太冗雜了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"耶奇·地心","speakerId":"avg_npc_564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你寧願繞這麼大一個彎，也不願意處理一下際崖城的穹頂？再怎麼說，就算芬奇是不辭而別，這也是你們師徒兩人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯第奇·畫布","speakerId":"avg_4054_malist_1","isRemote":false,"text":"停，到此為止。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯第奇·畫布","speakerId":"avg_4054_malist_1","isRemote":false,"text":"耶奇老頭，我不想和你真的生氣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"耶奇·地心","speakerId":"avg_npc_564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"耶奇·地心","speakerId":"avg_npc_564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在，還是解決源石勘測的問題更加重要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯第奇·畫布","speakerId":"avg_4054_malist_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在地上找到了幾個派得上用場的傢伙，他們那些折騰破爛的技術足夠幫際崖城重修鐵路了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯第奇·畫布","speakerId":"avg_4054_malist_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接下來，只要......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"耶奇·地心","speakerId":"avg_npc_564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不好意思打斷一下，你說的派得上用場的地上人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"耶奇·地心","speakerId":"avg_npc_564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不會是那邊正飛在天上的幾位吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯第奇·畫布","speakerId":"avg_4054_malist_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"30_g2_fountainlake"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_571_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唷吼！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"當初你、祖瑪瑪和克瑪爾加入羅德島的時候我還沒什麼感覺。現在看到這位的表現......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"特米米，你實話告訴我，羅德島的薪資是不是其實很好騙？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"avg_npc_572_1","isRemote":false,"text":"極境先生其實還是一位職業嚮導、通訊專家......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"avg_npc_572_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算了！他就那樣！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜林小販","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"兩位要的甜甜果酒~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"avg_npc_572_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，我該怎麼付錢，不如說，你們之前買東西都是怎麼付錢的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"avg_npc_572_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我給裁縫奶奶說了幾個嘉維爾的故事，她聽得很高興，就免費把衣服送給我了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_571_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的話......酒是愛好者協會的朋友們報銷，吃的就直接記到斯第奇的帳上了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"......大概你被丟到哪裡都活得下去吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_571_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這就是嚮導的專業性！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"小妹妹，那這兩杯酒也記在斯第奇先生帳上吧。他不會介意的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜林小販","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡奇·敘光","speakerId":"avg_npc_567_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，那傢伙可小氣得很，這些酒還是算我招待幾位的吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡奇·敘光","speakerId":"avg_npc_567_1","isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟這裡是我引以為傲的遊樂園，當然希望各位能玩個盡興。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"avg_npc_572_1","isRemote":false,"text":"敘光先生和斯第奇先生很熟嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡奇·敘光","speakerId":"avg_npc_567_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那要看你怎麼定義熟悉了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡奇·敘光","speakerId":"avg_npc_567_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們年輕的時候，為了把對方比下去，可是沒少打交道。我和他在好幾個項目上競過標，有的我勝，有的他勝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡奇·敘光","speakerId":"avg_npc_567_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過唯有我們頭頂的這座穹頂，倒是誰都沒有順利拿下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡奇·敘光","speakerId":"avg_npc_567_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們都對這座際崖城標誌性的穹頂有更多的改進設想，有幾年我們幾乎天天見面——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡奇·敘光","speakerId":"avg_npc_567_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在表決大會上，我們努力證明自己的穹頂改造方案是最好的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡奇·敘光","speakerId":"avg_npc_567_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然而，最後，誰都沒能說服際崖城的大多數人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡奇·敘光","speakerId":"avg_npc_567_1","isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟這座穹頂可是芬奇大師，也就是我之前那一任設計代表的手筆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡奇·敘光","speakerId":"avg_npc_567_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而斯第奇，既是他的學生，也是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡奇·敘光","speakerId":"avg_npc_567_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，有些話不應該我來說，你們還是自己問他吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_571_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡奇老弟啊，你小小年紀，怎麼老氣橫秋的，一口一個“年輕的時候”，這可不行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_571_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來，跟你極境哥學學，保持赤子之心，笑著面對生活！與其感歎以前的時光，不如和我們一起痛飲美酒——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜林小販","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"黎博利哥哥，你要的特大份超解暑冰冰涼麥酒桶來啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_571_1","isRemote":false,"text":"各位，別客氣！我們的朋友卡奇希望咱們盡興，怎麼能辜負他的好意呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_571_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以——卡奇老弟，我能再來點嗎？愛好者協會的那幫人不給我報銷別家的酒，我就是想都嘗嘗......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡奇·敘光","speakerId":"avg_npc_567_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡奇·敘光","speakerId":"avg_npc_567_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你真的不是個踩了高蹺的杜林人？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_caveentrance"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"思考的魯珀","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......還有什麼廣告要寫來著？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"思考的魯珀","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊對了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"思考的魯珀","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“我該怎麼形容這款長葉清露喝進喉嚨的感覺？我該怎麼不那麼市儈庸俗地讚美它？”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"思考的魯珀","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“倘若我能吞下一小片雲，倘若我能飲下一串春雨。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"思考的魯珀","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“倘若我能感受到冬天的最後兩片雪花落下......”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"思考的魯珀","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，他們大概不懂冬天的雪花，換個更杜林的比喻吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"思考的魯珀","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“兩塊超冰涼的果味冰塊落進一大壺無敵美味的調酒裡——”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，好疼——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這回我們不該往下跳的。大祭司居然說了句實話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"在上次和你打架之後，我好久沒體會過這種骨頭快要散架的感覺了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，我感覺自己都出現幻聽了，果味冰塊和酒之類的。難不成這一跳落下了什麼後遺症？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？這裡為什麼有個魯珀在睡覺？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"有沒有可能......是我們的錯呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......應該不會吧？要不然，我給她治療一下？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"你帶醫藥箱了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凱爾希醫生說過，真正傑出的醫療幹員用自己的雙手就能解決絕大部分問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"說過嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"具體的說法記不得了，反正我是這麼理解的。好了，讓我看看，該從哪裡下手呢......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魯珀","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，醒了。我還沒動手呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"那個......你還好嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魯珀","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，頭有點暈......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們剛剛好像不小心撞到你了，抱歉哈，需要我幫你看看嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魯珀","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們怎麼會在這裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魯珀","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們怎麼找到這裡的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能問個路嗎？你知道這附近有個神奇的地下城市之類的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魯珀","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你們是從地上來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真稀奇，你不是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"我們聽說地下有十分恐怖的災難將要發生，所以......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魯珀","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"地上人，你們最終還是來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魯珀","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“當然，帶著斧頭和鏈鋸探訪純潔的花園本來就是災難。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魯珀","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......“文明的野獸終於無意於掩蓋它尖銳的獠牙，向我們展露出了它噬人的巨口......”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白了，尖牙大嘴的野獸是吧，放心交給我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魯珀","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？不，我的意思是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要體型在十米以內，我就有信心把問題解決乾脆，正好，也好久沒動過手了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"魯珀小姐，帶個路，是往這邊走嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"應該繼續往下跳會比較快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魯珀","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，地上人！你們身上的血污，會......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別擔心，我會控制力道，不會濺得到處都是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"祖瑪瑪，做好再跳一次的準備了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"沒問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"魯珀小姐，抓緊我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"相信嘉維爾吧，論打架，她可是專業的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魯珀","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，其實也有別的路......喂，喂！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_416_zumama","aliases":["森蚺"]}]}
